{"sha": "593a67f01acd165dc5cc6688099efda81e19c85471708af211b2b4d757d89d11", "body": ["\\chapter{直线、圆与角}\\label{ch:g6:lines}", "", "几何从直尺、三角板和圆规开始。本章", "确定基本词汇 --- 点、线段、射线、直线、圆 ---", "介绍直线的两种特殊位置（平行与", "垂直），并讲授如何度量和画角。", "", "\\section{点、线段、直线}", "", "\\begin{definition}[基本对象]\\label{def:g6:lines:objects}", "过两个不同的点 $A$ 和 $B$ 可以画出以下对象：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{线段}\\index{线段} $[AB]$：直线上的", "        位于 $A$、$B$ 之间的部分（它有长度，记作 $AB$）；", "  \\item \\emph{射线} $[AB)$：从 $A$ 出发，经过 $B$，", "        并无限延伸；", "  \\item \\emph{直线}\\index{直线} $(AB)$：向两个方向", "        无限延伸。两点唯一确定一条直线。", "\\end{itemize}", "同一直线上的点称为\\emph{共线}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\fill (0,1.8) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (2.5,1.8) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (0,1.8) -- (2.5,1.8);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (2.9,1.8) {线段 $[AB]$};", "  \\fill (0,0.9) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (2.5,0.9) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0.9) -- (4.1,0.9);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (4.3,0.9) {射线 $[AB)$};", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (2.5,0) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\draw[thick, omMeth] (-1.4,0) -- (4.1,0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (4.3,0) {直线 $(AB)$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两个相同的点，三种不同的对象。方括号表示", "哪一端停止、哪一端延伸：$[$ 表示停止，$($ 表示延伸。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{平行线与垂线}", "", "\\begin{definition}[垂直、平行]\\label{def:g6:lines:perp}", "两条直线相交成直角时，称它们\\emph{垂直}\\index{垂直}，", "记作 $d_1 \\perp d_2$，直角处用小方块标出。", "若两条直线无论延伸多远都不相交，", "则称它们\\emph{平行}\\index{平行}，", "记作 $d_1 \\parallel d_2$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\draw[thick] (-1.8,0) -- (1.8,0) node[right, font=\\small] {$d_1$};", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (0.6,-1.2) -- (0.6,1.4)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$d_2$};", "  \\draw[thin] (0.6,0) ++(-0.25,0) -- ++(0,0.25) -- ++(0.25,0);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.5) {$d_1 \\perp d_2$};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.5cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (-1.8,-0.5) -- (1.8,0.3) node[right, font=\\small] {$d_3$};", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (-1.8,-1.3) -- (1.8,-0.5)", "    node[right, font=\\small] {$d_4$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.5) {$d_3 \\parallel d_4$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 直角相交（用小方块标出）与两条平行线：", "方向相同，且没有交点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[两个有用的结论]\\label{prop:g6:lines:facts}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若两条直线都与第三条直线垂直，则它们", "        彼此平行。", "  \\item 若两条直线平行，则与其中一条垂直的每一条直线", "        也与另一条垂直。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{method}[用三角板作图]\\label{met:g6:lines:setsquare}", "要作直线 $d$ 的垂线，使其过点 $P$：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将三角板直角的一条边沿 $d$ 放置；", "  \\item 沿 $d$ 平移三角板，直至它的另一条边", "        到达 $P$；", "  \\item 沿该边画线，并标出直角。", "\\end{enumerate}", "过 $P$ 作平行线时，先作 $d$ 的垂线，再", "过 $P$ 作\\emph{该}垂线的垂线", "（见\\cref{prop:g6:lines:facts}）。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{圆}", "", "\\begin{definition}[圆]\\label{def:g6:lines:circle}", "圆心为 $O$、半径为 $r$ 的\\emph{圆}\\index{圆}是", "所有点的集合，这些点的距离恰为 $r$（从 $O$ 量起）。", "连接圆心与圆上一点的线段称为\\emph{半径}；", "连接圆上两点且过圆心的线段称为\\emph{直径} ---", "其长度为 $2r$；连接圆上两点的线段称为\\emph{弦}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.15]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.5);", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt) node[below left, font=\\small] {$O$};", "  \\fill (1.5,0) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$M$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) -- (1.5,0)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {半径};", "  \\fill (-1.06,1.06) circle (1.5pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (1.06,-1.06) circle (1.5pt) node[below right, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (-1.06,1.06) -- (1.06,-1.06)", "    node[pos=0.25, right=2pt, font=\\small] {直径};", "  \\fill (0.52,1.41) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\fill (1.41,0.52) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$D$};", "  \\draw[omMeth, thick] (0.52,1.41) -- (1.41,0.52)", "    node[midway, above right=-2pt, font=\\small] {弦};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}